## Installation

The chart is distributed only as an OCI artifact on ghcr.io, so `helm search repo` does not work. List versions with [crane](https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/blob/main/cmd/crane/README.md):

```console
crane ls ghcr.io/kattler/charts/{{ template "chart.name" . }}
```

Install:

```console
helm install {{ template "chart.name" . }} oci://ghcr.io/kattler/charts/{{ template "chart.name" . }} \
  --version {{ template "chart.version" . }} \
  -f values.yaml
```

Inspect the chart before installing:

```console
helm show values oci://ghcr.io/kattler/charts/{{ template "chart.name" . }} --version {{ template "chart.version" . }}
```

Upgrade and uninstall:

```console
helm upgrade {{ template "chart.name" . }} oci://ghcr.io/kattler/charts/{{ template "chart.name" . }} --version {{ template "chart.version" . }} -f values.yaml
helm uninstall {{ template "chart.name" . }}
```

